{"code": "ja", "name": "Japanese", "native": "日本語", "phase": 1, "medium": "en", "file_level": "A1", "pronunciation": [{"t": "Vowels are pure: a-i-u-e-o", "r": "ah-ee-oo-eh-oh", "tip": "Always the same! さくら (sakura) = sa-koo-ra, never Say-koo-ra."}, {"t": "は as a particle sounds like WA", "r": "wa", "tip": "わたしは = watashi-WA (I). Written HA, spoken WA!"}, {"t": "へ as a particle sounds like E", "r": "e", "tip": "がっこうへ = gakkou-E (to school). Written HE, spoken E!"}, {"t": "Double consonants pause: きって", "r": "kit-te", "tip": "きって (kitte) = stamp: tiny stop between T's. きた (kita) = came — no stop!"}, {"t": "Long vowels stretch: おかあさん", "r": "okaa-san", "tip": "おばさん (aunt) vs おばあさん (grandma) — length changes meaning!"}], "alphabet": {"title": "Hiragana: the 46 basic sounds", "explain": "Japanese has 3 scripts! Start with HIRAGANA (curvy, for Japanese words). KATAKANA (angular, for foreign words) and KANJI (Chinese characters) come later. Master these 46 sounds first!", "letters": [{"t": "あ", "r": "a"}, {"t": "い", "r": "i (ee)"}, {"t": "う", "r": "u (oo)"}, {"t": "え", "r": "e (eh)"}, {"t": "お", "r": "o (oh)"}, {"t": "か", "r": "ka"}, {"t": "き", "r": "ki"}, {"t": "く", "r": "ku"}, {"t": "け", "r": "ke"}, {"t": "こ", "r": "ko"}, {"t": "さ", "r": "sa"}, {"t": "し", "r": "shi"}, {"t": "す", "r": "su"}, {"t": "せ", "r": "se"}, {"t": "そ", "r": "so"}, {"t": "た", "r": "ta"}, {"t": "ち", "r": "chi"}, {"t": "つ", "r": "tsu"}, {"t": "て", "r": "te"}, {"t": "と", "r": "to"}, {"t": "な", "r": "na"}, {"t": "に", "r": "ni"}, {"t": "ぬ", "r": "nu"}, {"t": "ね", "r": "ne"}, {"t": "の", "r": "no"}, {"t": "は", "r": "ha (wa as particle)"}, {"t": "ひ", "r": "hi"}, {"t": "ふ", "r": "fu"}, {"t": "へ", "r": "he (e as particle)"}, {"t": "ほ", "r": "ho"}, {"t": "ま", "r": "ma"}, {"t": "み", "r": "mi"}, {"t": "む", "r": "mu"}, {"t": "め", "r": "me"}, {"t": "も", "r": "mo"}, {"t": "や", "r": "ya"}, {"t": "ゆ", "r": "yu"}, {"t": "よ", "r": "yo"}, {"t": "ら", "r": "ra"}, {"t": "り", "r": "ri"}, {"t": "る", "r": "ru"}, {"t": "れ", "r": "re"}, {"t": "ろ", "r": "ro"}, {"t": "わ", "r": "wa"}, {"t": "を", "r": "wo (o as particle)"}, {"t": "ん", "r": "n"}]}, "counting": {"title": "Counting 0 to 100", "explain": "Learn 1–10, then stack: 11 = じゅういち (10-1), 20 = にじゅう (2-10s), 21 = にじゅういち. 4 = よん, 7 = なな, 9 = きゅう (safe forms)!", "numbers": [{"t": "れい", "r": "rei", "en": "0"}, {"t": "いち", "r": "ichi", "en": "1"}, {"t": "に", "r": "ni", "en": "2"}, {"t": "さん", "r": "san", "en": "3"}, {"t": "よん", "r": "yon", "en": "4"}, {"t": "ご", "r": "go", "en": "5"}, {"t": "ろく", "r": "roku", "en": "6"}, {"t": "なな", "r": "nana", "en": "7"}, {"t": "はち", "r": "hachi", "en": "8"}, {"t": "きゅう", "r": "kyuu", "en": "9"}, {"t": "じゅう", "r": "juu", "en": "10"}, {"t": "じゅういち", "r": "juu-ichi", "en": "11"}, {"t": "じゅうに", "r": "juu-ni", "en": "12"}, {"t": "じゅうさん", "r": "juu-san", "en": "13"}, {"t": "じゅうよん", "r": "juu-yon", "en": "14"}, {"t": "じゅうご", "r": "juu-go", "en": "15"}, {"t": "じゅうろく", "r": "juu-roku", "en": "16"}, {"t": "じゅうなな", "r": "juu-nana", "en": "17"}, {"t": "じゅうはち", "r": "juu-hachi", "en": "18"}, {"t": "じゅうきゅう", "r": "juu-kyuu", "en": "19"}, {"t": "にじゅう", "r": "ni-juu", "en": "20"}, {"t": "さんじゅう", "r": "san-juu", "en": "30"}, {"t": "よんじゅう", "r": "yon-juu", "en": "40"}, {"t": "ごじゅう", "r": "go-juu", "en": "50"}, {"t": "ろくじゅう", "r": "roku-juu", "en": "60"}, {"t": "ななじゅう", "r": "nana-juu", "en": "70"}, {"t": "はちじゅう", "r": "hachi-juu", "en": "80"}, {"t": "きゅうじゅう", "r": "kyuu-juu", "en": "90"}, {"t": "ひゃく", "r": "hyaku", "en": "100"}], "rules": ["11–19 = じゅう + ones: じゅういち = 11.", "Tens = number + じゅう: にじゅう = 20. Use よん/なな/きゅう to avoid unlucky し/く readings!"]}, "level": {"title": "Starter: greetings, です, first verbs", "goals": ["Greet people and introduce yourself", "Use です, これ/それ/あれ and counters", "Use ます-verbs and あります/います"], "units": [{"id": "A1-U1", "title": "First words", "lessons": [{"id": "A1-U1-L1", "title": "Greetings: こんにちは", "learn": "こんにちは (hello), おはよう (morning!), こんばんは (evening!). Meeting: はじめまして (nice to meet you) → わたしは + name + です → よろしくおねがいします (please treat me well)! Bow slightly!", "vocab": [{"t": "こんにちは", "r": "konnichiwa", "en": "hello", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "おはよう", "r": "ohayou", "en": "good morning", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "こんばんは", "r": "konbanwa", "en": "good evening", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "はじめまして", "r": "hajimemashite", "en": "nice to meet you", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "ありがとう", "r": "arigatou", "en": "thanks", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "すみません", "r": "sumimasen", "en": "excuse me / sorry", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "はい", "r": "hai", "en": "yes", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "いいえ", "r": "iie", "en": "no", "pos": "phrase"}], "grammar": {"title": "はじめまして、わたしはXです", "explain": "わたしはゆきです = I am Yuki. は (wa) marks the topic, です ends politely. Finish with よろしくおねがいします = please be kind to me!", "pattern": "はじめまして、わたしは + name + です", "examples": [{"t": "はじめまして、わたしはゆきです。", "r": "hajimemashite, watashi-wa yuki desu.", "en": "Nice to meet you, I am Yuki."}, {"t": "よろしくおねがいします。", "r": "yoroshiku onegai-shimasu.", "en": "Please treat me well."}, {"t": "ありがとう!", "r": "arigatou!", "en": "Thanks!"}], "mistakes": ["Saying わたしはは — one は is enough!", "Skipping よろしく — introductions NEED it!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "ゆき", "t": "はじめまして、わたしはゆきです。", "r": "hajimemashite, watashi-wa yuki desu.", "en": "Nice to meet you, I am Yuki."}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "はじめまして、わたしはたろうです。", "r": "hajimemashite, watashi-wa tarou desu.", "en": "Nice to meet you, I am Taro."}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "よろしくおねがいします!", "r": "yoroshiku onegai-shimasu!", "en": "Please treat me well!"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "こちらこそ!", "r": "kochira-koso!", "en": "Same here!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: I am Yuki", "answer": "わたしはゆきです"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "___! (Nice to meet you)", "answer": "はじめまして"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "Introductions end with…", "options": ["ありがとう", "よろしくおねがいします", "すみません", "さようなら"], "answer": "よろしくおねがいします"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: ゆきです / わたしは", "answer": "わたしはゆきです"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: はじめまして、わたしはゆきです。", "answer": "はじめまして、わたしはゆきです。"}], "quiz": [{"q": "はじめまして means…", "options": ["hello", "nice to meet you", "goodbye", "thanks"], "answer": 1, "why": "First-meeting greeting."}, {"q": "よろしくおねがいします means…", "options": ["thank you", "please treat me well", "excuse me", "good luck"], "answer": 1, "why": "Introduction closer."}, {"q": "すみません means…", "options": ["thanks", "excuse me / sorry", "hello", "yes"], "answer": 1, "why": "すみません = sorry/excuse me."}, {"q": "こちらこそ means…", "options": ["me too / same here", "goodbye", "never", "maybe"], "answer": 0, "why": "こちらこそ = right back at you."}, {"q": "は in わたしは sounds like…", "options": ["ha", "wa", "he", "wo"], "answer": 1, "why": "Particle は = WA!"}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "Greetings worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["hello", "thanks", "yes"], "key": ["こんにちは", "ありがとう", "はい"]}, {"instruction": "Introduce yourself.", "items": ["Nice to meet you, I am Yuki", "Please treat me well"], "key": ["はじめまして、わたしはゆきです", "よろしくおねがいします"]}, {"instruction": "Dayparts.", "items": ["good morning", "good evening"], "key": ["おはよう", "こんばんは"]}]}}, {"id": "A1-U1-L2", "title": "Names and おげんきですか", "learn": "Ask names: おなまえは? (your name?) → わたしは…です. How are you: おげんきですか? → はい、げんきです! か turns anything into a question: ゆきですか? = Are you Yuki?", "vocab": [{"t": "わたし", "r": "watashi", "en": "I / me", "pos": "pronoun"}, {"t": "あなた", "r": "anata", "en": "you", "pos": "pronoun"}, {"t": "なまえ", "r": "namae", "en": "name", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "おげんきですか", "r": "o-genki desu ka", "en": "how are you", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "げんき", "r": "genki", "en": "fine / healthy", "pos": "adjective"}, {"t": "あなたは", "r": "anata-wa", "en": "and you", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "ください", "r": "kudasai", "en": "please (give me)", "pos": "phrase"}, {"t": "どうも", "r": "doumo", "en": "thanks (casual)", "pos": "phrase"}], "grammar": {"title": "か = question mark in speech", "explain": "げんきです (I'm fine) → げんきですか? (are you fine?). Just add か! おなまえは? = Your name? (polite). あなたは? = And you?", "pattern": "sentence + か?", "examples": [{"t": "おげんきですか?", "r": "o-genki desu ka?", "en": "How are you?"}, {"t": "はい、げんきです!", "r": "hai, genki desu!", "en": "Yes, I'm fine!"}, {"t": "おなまえは?", "r": "o-namae-wa?", "en": "Your name?"}], "mistakes": ["Raising voice WITHOUT か — questions need か!", "Overusing あなた — names + さん are warmer!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "たろう", "t": "おなまえは?", "r": "o-namae-wa?", "en": "Your name?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "わたしはゆきです。おげんきですか?", "r": "watashi-wa yuki desu. o-genki desu ka?", "en": "I am Yuki. How are you?"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "はい、げんきです! あなたは?", "r": "hai, genki desu! anata-wa?", "en": "Yes, I'm fine! And you?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "げんきです!", "r": "genki desu!", "en": "I'm fine!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: How are you?", "answer": "おげんきですか"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "はい、___です! (fine)", "answer": "げんき"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "か at the end makes…", "options": ["past tense", "a question", "a command", "plural"], "answer": "a question"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: ですか / おげんき", "answer": "おげんきですか"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: おげんきですか?", "answer": "おげんきですか?"}], "quiz": [{"q": "おげんきですか? means…", "options": ["what is this", "how are you", "where are you", "who are you"], "answer": 1, "why": "おげんきですか = how are you."}, {"q": "か turns sentences into…", "options": ["orders", "questions", "past", "negative"], "answer": 1, "why": "です→ですか? = is?/are?."}, {"q": "おなまえは? means…", "options": ["my name", "your name?", "his name", "no name"], "answer": 1, "why": "おなまえは = your name?"}, {"q": "げんき means…", "options": ["tired", "fine / healthy", "busy", "sad"], "answer": 1, "why": "げんき = fine/well."}, {"q": "ください means…", "options": ["thanks", "please (give me)", "sorry", "hello"], "answer": 1, "why": "ください = please give/do."}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "Questions worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["I", "you", "name"], "key": ["わたし", "あなた", "なまえ"]}, {"instruction": "Ask with か.", "items": ["How are you?", "Your name?", "And you?"], "key": ["おげんきですか", "おなまえは", "あなたは"]}, {"instruction": "Answer.", "items": ["Yes, I'm fine!", "I'm fine!"], "key": ["はい、げんきです", "げんきです"]}]}}]}, {"id": "A1-U2", "title": "です and counters", "lessons": [{"id": "A1-U2-L1", "title": "です and これ/それ/あれ", "learn": "Point at things! これ (this-near-me), それ (that-near-you), あれ (that-far). これはほんです = This is a book. Negative: ほんじゃありません (it's not a book). Point and name the world!", "vocab": [{"t": "これ", "r": "kore", "en": "this (near me)", "pos": "pronoun"}, {"t": "それ", "r": "sore", "en": "that (near you)", "pos": "pronoun"}, {"t": "あれ", "r": "are", "en": "that (far)", "pos": "pronoun"}, {"t": "ほん", "r": "hon", "en": "book", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "がっこう", "r": "gakkou", "en": "school", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "くるま", "r": "kuruma", "en": "car", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "おおきい", "r": "ookii", "en": "big", "pos": "adjective"}, {"t": "ちいさい", "r": "chiisai", "en": "small", "pos": "adjective"}], "grammar": {"title": "これはXです · じゃありません", "explain": "これはほんです (this is a book), それはくるまです (that is a car). Negative: これはほんじゃありません (this is not a book). Adjectives sit BEFORE nouns: おおきいほん!", "pattern": "これ/それ/あれ + は + X + です", "examples": [{"t": "これはほんです。", "r": "kore-wa hon desu.", "en": "This is a book."}, {"t": "それはくるまです。", "r": "sore-wa kuruma desu.", "en": "That is a car."}, {"t": "これはほんじゃありません。", "r": "kore-wa hon-ja arimasen.", "en": "This is not a book."}], "mistakes": ["Saying これほんです without は — topic needs は!", "Saying ほんですおおきい — adjectives go FIRST: おおきいほん!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "ゆき", "t": "これはほんですか?", "r": "kore-wa hon desu ka?", "en": "Is this a book?"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "はい、これはおおきいほんです。", "r": "hai, kore-wa ookii hon desu.", "en": "Yes, this is a big book."}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "あれはがっこうですか?", "r": "are-wa gakkou desu ka?", "en": "Is that (far) a school?"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "はい!", "r": "hai!", "en": "Yes!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: This is a book", "answer": "これはほんです"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "___はくるまです。 (That near you)", "answer": "それ"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "'This is not a book' is…", "options": ["これはほんです", "これはほんじゃありません", "これはほんでした", "これはほんですか"], "answer": "これはほんじゃありません"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: ほんです / これは", "answer": "これはほんです"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: これはほんです。", "answer": "これはほんです。"}], "quiz": [{"q": "それ points…", "options": ["near me", "near you", "far", "nowhere"], "answer": 1, "why": "それ = near-listener."}, {"q": "あれ points…", "options": ["near me", "near you", "far from both", "at me"], "answer": 2, "why": "あれ = far away."}, {"q": "じゃありません means…", "options": ["is", "is not", "was", "will be"], "answer": 1, "why": "じゃありません = is-not."}, {"q": "おおきいほん means…", "options": ["book is big", "big book", "my book", "that book"], "answer": 1, "why": "Adjective-first: big book."}, {"q": "くるま means…", "options": ["school", "car", "book", "house"], "answer": 1, "why": "くるま = car."}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "Pointing worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["this (near me)", "that (far)", "book"], "key": ["これ", "あれ", "ほん"]}, {"instruction": "Point and name.", "items": ["This is a book", "That (near you) is a car", "This is not a book"], "key": ["これはほんです", "それはくるまです", "これはほんじゃありません"]}, {"instruction": "Ask.", "items": ["Is this a book?", "Yes!"], "key": ["これはほんですか", "はい"]}]}}, {"id": "A1-U2-L2", "title": "Counters: ひとつ、ふたつ", "learn": "Count THINGS with つ! ひとつ (1 thing), ふたつ (2), みっつ (3) — up to とお (10). People: ひとり、ふたり. いくつ? = How many? ほんをみっつください! = Three books, please!", "vocab": [{"t": "ひとつ", "r": "hitotsu", "en": "one thing", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "ふたつ", "r": "futatsu", "en": "two things", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "みっつ", "r": "mittsu", "en": "three things", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "いち", "r": "ichi", "en": "one", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "に", "r": "ni", "en": "two", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "さん", "r": "san", "en": "three", "pos": "number"}, {"t": "たくさん", "r": "takusan", "en": "many / a lot", "pos": "adverb"}, {"t": "すこし", "r": "sukoshi", "en": "a little", "pos": "adverb"}], "grammar": {"title": "つ-counter for things", "explain": "りんごをみっつ (3 apples), ほんをひとつ (1 book). を marks the object! いくつですか? = How many? Answer: みっつです!", "pattern": "X を + counter + ください", "examples": [{"t": "ほんをみっつください。", "r": "hon-o mittsu kudasai.", "en": "Three books, please."}, {"t": "いくつですか?", "r": "ikutsu desu ka?", "en": "How many?"}, {"t": "ふたつです。", "r": "futatsu desu.", "en": "Two."}], "mistakes": ["Saying ほんさん — things need みっつ-style counters!", "Forgetting を: ほんをみっつ with を!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "たろう", "t": "りんごはいくつですか?", "r": "ringo-wa ikutsu desu ka?", "en": "How many apples?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "みっつです!", "r": "mittsu desu!", "en": "Three!"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "みっつください!", "r": "mittsu kudasai!", "en": "Three, please!"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "どうぞ!", "r": "douzo!", "en": "Here you go!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: Three books, please", "answer": "ほんをみっつください"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "___ですか? (How many?)", "answer": "いくつ"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "'Two things' is…", "options": ["に", "ふたつ", "ふたり", "にじゅう"], "answer": "ふたつ"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: みっつ / ほんを / ください", "answer": "ほんをみっつください"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: ほんをみっつください。", "answer": "ほんをみっつください。"}], "quiz": [{"q": "みっつ means…", "options": ["2 things", "3 things", "3rd", "three times"], "answer": 1, "why": "みっつ = three things."}, {"q": "いくつですか? asks…", "options": ["how much", "how many", "where", "what"], "answer": 1, "why": "いくつ = how many."}, {"q": "を marks…", "options": ["subject", "object", "place", "time"], "answer": 1, "why": "ほんを = book (object)."}, {"q": "とお means…", "options": ["5 things", "10 things", "100", "many"], "answer": 1, "why": "とお = ten things."}, {"q": "ふたつください means…", "options": ["two, please", "three, please", "how many?", "here you go"], "answer": 0, "why": "ふたつ + ください = two please."}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "Counters worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["one thing", "three things", "many"], "key": ["ひとつ", "みっつ", "たくさん"]}, {"instruction": "Order things.", "items": ["Three books, please", "How many?", "Two"], "key": ["ほんをみっつください", "いくつですか", "ふたつです"]}, {"instruction": "Shop.", "items": ["Three, please!", "Here you go!"], "key": ["みっつください", "どうぞ"]}]}}]}, {"id": "A1-U3", "title": "First verbs", "lessons": [{"id": "A1-U3-L1", "title": "ます-verbs: たべます", "learn": "Verbs end in ます! たべます (I eat), のみます (I drink). Negative: たべません (don't eat). Past: たべました (ate)! Same ending for I/you/he — NO conjugation! Just add time words!", "vocab": [{"t": "たべます", "r": "tabemasu", "en": "to eat", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "のみます", "r": "nomimasu", "en": "to drink", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "よみます", "r": "yomimasu", "en": "to read", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "かきます", "r": "kakimasu", "en": "to write", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "はなします", "r": "hanashimasu", "en": "to speak", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "べんきょうします", "r": "benkyou-shimasu", "en": "to study", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "はたらきます", "r": "hatarakimasu", "en": "to work", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "すみます", "r": "sumimasu", "en": "to live", "pos": "verb"}], "grammar": {"title": "ます/ません/ました", "explain": "たべます (eat), たべません (don't eat), たべました (ate), たべませんでした (didn't eat). Pronouns optional: たべます = I/you/he eats — context decides!", "pattern": "ます · ません · ました", "examples": [{"t": "わたしはパンをたべます。", "r": "watashi-wa pan-o tabemasu.", "en": "I eat bread."}, {"t": "にほんごをはなします。", "r": "nihongo-o hanashimasu.", "en": "I speak Japanese."}, {"t": "きのう、ほんをよみました。", "r": "kinou, hon-o yomimashita.", "en": "Yesterday, I read a book."}], "mistakes": ["Saying わたしはたべます always — drop わたしは mostly!", "Saying たべます for past — past needs たべました!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "ゆき", "t": "えいごをはなしますか?", "r": "eigo-o hanashimasu ka?", "en": "Do you speak English?"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "はい、はなします! あなたは?", "r": "hai, hanashimasu! anata-wa?", "en": "Yes, I speak! And you?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "わたしはにほんごをはなします!", "r": "watashi-wa nihongo-o hanashimasu!", "en": "I speak Japanese!"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "すごい!", "r": "sugoi!", "en": "Amazing!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: I eat bread", "answer": "わたしはパンをたべます"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "ほんを___。 (read)", "answer": "よみます"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "'Yesterday I read a book' is…", "options": ["きのう、ほんをよみます", "きのう、ほんをよみました", "きのう、ほんをよみません", "あした、ほんをよみました"], "answer": "きのう、ほんをよみました"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: たべます / パンを / わたしは", "answer": "わたしはパンをたべます"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: わたしはパンをたべます。", "answer": "わたしはパンをたべます。"}], "quiz": [{"q": "たべません means…", "options": ["eat", "don't eat", "ate", "will eat"], "answer": 1, "why": "ません = negative."}, {"q": "たべました means…", "options": ["eat", "don't eat", "ate", "want eat"], "answer": 2, "why": "ました = past."}, {"q": "はなします means…", "options": ["to eat", "to speak", "to read", "to write"], "answer": 1, "why": "はなします = to speak."}, {"q": "Subjects like わたしは are…", "options": ["required", "usually dropped", "forbidden", "plural-only"], "answer": 1, "why": "Context decides — drop them!"}, {"q": "えいご means…", "options": ["Japanese", "English", "book", "school"], "answer": 1, "why": "えいご = English."}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "ます-verbs worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["to eat", "to speak", "to live"], "key": ["たべます", "はなします", "すみます"]}, {"instruction": "ます/ません/ました.", "items": ["I eat", "I don't eat", "I ate"], "key": ["たべます", "たべません", "たべました"]}, {"instruction": "Ask.", "items": ["Do you speak English?", "Amazing!"], "key": ["えいごをはなしますか", "すごい"]}]}}, {"id": "A1-U3-L2", "title": "あります / います", "learn": "THERE IS splits two ways! あります (things exist), います (living things exist). ほんがあります (there is a book), ともだちがいます (there is a friend). が marks what exists!", "vocab": [{"t": "あります", "r": "arimasu", "en": "there is (things)", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "います", "r": "imasu", "en": "there is (living)", "pos": "verb"}, {"t": "みず", "r": "mizu", "en": "water", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "いえ", "r": "ie", "en": "house", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "おかね", "r": "okane", "en": "money", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "ともだち", "r": "tomodachi", "en": "friend", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "じかん", "r": "jikan", "en": "time", "pos": "noun"}, {"t": "パン", "r": "pan", "en": "bread", "pos": "noun"}], "grammar": {"title": "あります (things) / います (living)", "explain": "ほんがあります (a book exists = I have a book), ねこがいます (a cat exists). In-places: つくえのうえにほんがあります (on the desk, a book exists)!", "pattern": "X が + あります/います", "examples": [{"t": "ほんがあります。", "r": "hon-ga arimasu.", "en": "There is a book. / I have a book."}, {"t": "ともだちがいます。", "r": "tomodachi-ga imasu.", "en": "There is a friend."}, {"t": "おかねがありません。", "r": "okane-ga arimasen.", "en": "There is no money."}], "mistakes": ["Saying ともだちがあります — living things need います!", "Forgetting が: ほんが with が!"]}, "dialogue": [{"sp": "たろう", "t": "おかねがありますか?", "r": "okane-ga arimasu ka?", "en": "Do you have money?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "はい、あります! パンもあります!", "r": "hai, arimasu! pan-mo arimasu!", "en": "Yes, I do! Bread too!"}, {"sp": "たろう", "t": "ありがとう! ともだちがいますか?", "r": "arigatou! tomodachi-ga imasu ka?", "en": "Thanks! Do you have friends? / Is there a friend?"}, {"sp": "ゆき", "t": "はい、います!", "r": "hai, imasu!", "en": "Yes!"}], "practice": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: There is a book", "answer": "ほんがあります"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "ともだちが___。 (exists, living)", "answer": "います"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "'There is no money' is…", "options": ["おかねがあります", "おかねがありません", "おかねがいました", "おかねをあります"], "answer": "おかねがありません"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: あります / ほんが", "answer": "ほんがあります"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: ほんがあります。", "answer": "ほんがあります。"}], "quiz": [{"q": "ほんがあります means…", "options": ["I want a book", "there is a book", "I read a book", "I see a book"], "answer": 1, "why": "があります = exists (thing)."}, {"q": "Living things use…", "options": ["あります", "います", "です", "します"], "answer": 1, "why": "います = living exists."}, {"q": "が marks…", "options": ["topic", "what exists", "object", "place"], "answer": 1, "why": "ほんが = book (exists)."}, {"q": "ともだち means…", "options": ["book", "friend", "money", "time"], "answer": 1, "why": "ともだち = friend."}, {"q": "パン means…", "options": ["water", "bread", "house", "rice"], "answer": 1, "why": "パン = bread."}], "flashcards": "auto:vocab", "worksheet": {"title": "Existence worksheet", "tasks": [{"instruction": "Translate to Japanese.", "items": ["there is (things)", "there is (living)", "money"], "key": ["あります", "います", "おかね"]}, {"instruction": "Exists or not.", "items": ["There is a book", "There is a friend", "There is no money"], "key": ["ほんがあります", "ともだちがいます", "おかねがありません"]}, {"instruction": "Ask.", "items": ["Do you have money?", "Yes!"], "key": ["おかねがありますか", "はい"]}]}}]}], "test": {"title": "A1 final test", "items": [{"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: I am Yuki", "answer": "わたしはゆきです"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "___! (Nice to meet you)", "answer": "はじめまして"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "Introductions end with…", "options": ["ありがとう", "よろしくおねがいします", "すみません", "さようなら"], "answer": "よろしくおねがいします"}, {"type": "translate_en", "q": "Say: I eat bread", "answer": "わたしはパンをたべます"}, {"type": "translate_t", "q": "ほんがあります。", "answer": "There is a book."}, {"type": "fill", "q": "___はくるまです。 (That near you)", "answer": "それ"}, {"type": "reorder", "q": "Order: ですか / おげんき", "answer": "おげんきですか"}, {"type": "speak", "q": "Say aloud: わたしはパンをたべます。", "answer": "わたしはパンをたべます。"}, {"type": "fill", "q": "ともだちが___。 (exists, living)", "answer": "います"}, {"type": "choose", "q": "きのう、ほんをよみました。", "options": ["I read books", "Yesterday I read a book", "I will read", "I don't read"], "answer": "Yesterday I read a book"}]}}}